		{"id":"1b2c3d4e5f67890a","type":"text","text":"### 🎯 Focus & Goal KTI Gemastik 2026\n\n- **Topik Utama:** *Single & Multi Secret Sharing Scheme* (CRT, Modified Shamir, Bitwise XOR).\n- **Fokus Riset:** Efisiensi & Fleksibilitas pengamanan citra digital sensitif.\n- **Arah Pivot:** Pengembangan dari skema $(n,n)$ single secret ke multi-secret/threshold.","x":-80,"y":-800,"width":400,"height":340,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"4e5f67890a1b2c3d","type":"text","text":"### 📑 Deep-Dive Paper Analysis\n\n- **Paper Referensi:** Dinesh Pande et al. (2023)\n- **Mekanisme Algoritma:**\n  1. Modulo Reduction via CRT\n  2. Shade Distribution via Shamir SSS\n  3. Fast Encryption via Bitwise XOR","x":720,"y":-700,"width":400,"height":300,"color":"6"},
